<title>ITALY: Enel 1996 net profit up 10.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Enel 1996 net profit up 10.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year months ended December 31</p>
<p>(In trillon lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 36.77  vs 36.11</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.272  vs 1.147</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	     14.67  vs 14.19</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.31   vs 8.38</p>
<p>    Net financial charges		2.52   vs 3.33</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		  67.8 bln vs 483.4 bln</p>
<p>    Tax charges			    2.43   vs 2.05</p>
<p>    Financial debt			 34.34  vs 35.10</p>
<p>Note - Electricity group Enel said the rise in profits was achieved notwithstanding a cut in tariff charges.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
